            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo no kere Hezekia two omako aka obothi tho. Isaya jatuci wac Were wod Amoz obino bonge to waco rigo ni, “Me apaka Rwoth waco: ‘Kethi gigipiny je i kare, kole ikilaboth, ibino tho.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Hezekia owire to ŋiyo kor ot aka okwayo ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Awi Rwoth, mondo akwayin, poyi paka awotho ruwaŋin iy'adieri aka gi cunyan je. Atieko timo gim'otire ruwaŋin.” Kenyo Hezekia oywaki gi geregere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ri Isaya ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Giki bongi Hezekia jadhum pa ji paran iwaci rigo ni Rwoth, Were pa kwarin Daudi waco ni owinjo kwayo perin to neno pigi waŋin. Go lamedin oro apar g'abic man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go labotho tindi madwoŋ Yerusalem kwoŋ kere ma Asiria aka lamedo kikwonga tindi madwoŋ me.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Me ranyuth rin wok bongi Rwoth, ni Rwoth bino timo gima go ociko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neni, alamiyo tipo gik cen ma madala ma kere Ahaz ogeto dipar.” Ameno tipo owire gik cen ma madala dipar m'oyido.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen munyo Kere Hezekia otieko both kwoŋ two pere, ondiko wer ma pak me:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaya oyido owaco ni, wonyadhi nyandere wokethi i bur pa Hezekia, ŋey wocangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere Hezekia openjo Isaya ni, “Aŋo ma nyutho ni abino kidho i Ot pa Rwoth?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
